  "description": "Some bikes are built to look adventurous. Others are built to go there. The Havok does both — built for long miles, high passes, and terrain that tests more than your gearing, where the road fades and the ride begins.\n\nWith a rigid fork and fast-rolling tires, it carries speed across gravel and long mixed-surface routes with efficiency and control. Install a 100mm suspension fork and 29 x 3.0” tires, and the same frame gains traction and confidence for rough doubletrack, remote backcountry routes, and demanding bikepacking terrain.\n\nThe geometry supports both drop-bar and flat-bar configurations, allowing riders to refine fit, handling, and body position based on terrain or objective. Adjustable chainstays further tune rear-end feel depending on load, tire choice, or riding style.",
